{
  "id": "北海",
  "name": "北海",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [
    "北之海"
  ],
  "type": "river",
  "typeConfidence": "high",
  "description": "水名，一说这里指贝加尔湖",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-03-28",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，一说这里指贝加尔湖"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-03-28",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "敦题之山，无草木，多金玉。是于北海。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-04-36",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，一说这里指今莱州湾"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-04-36",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "东次四经之首，曰北号之山，临于北海。有木焉，其状如杨，赤华，其实"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-08-14",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "古代泛指北方僻远之地。秦汉时也指里海、贝加尔湖等大泽"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-08-14",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "北海内有兽，其状如马，名曰。有兽焉"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-16-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西北海之外，大荒之隅，有山而不合，名"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-16-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西北海之外，赤水一之东，有长胫之国名"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "东北海之外，大荒之中，河水之间，附禺"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "儋耳之国，任姓，禺号子，食谷。北海之渚中，有神，人面鸟身，珥两青"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-19",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "烛阴西北海之外，赤水之北，有章尾山。有神"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-01",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，这里指渤海"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "东海之内，北海之隅，有国名曰朝鲜、天毒，其人"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-16",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "北海之内，有山名曰幽都之山，黑水出"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "soushenji-02-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "汉北海营陵有道人，能令人与已死人相见"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 24,
      "entryId": "soushenji-24-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "子，年十八九，言：“我是前太守北海徐玄方女，不幸蚤亡。亡来今已四"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-14-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "其门，终身不勤。”\n\n卢敖游乎北海，经乎太阴，入乎玄阙，至于蒙谷"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 3
  }
}
